{"id":"n14649-1-9","stage":3,"title":"꾸리다 · 收拾","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14649-1-9-1","ko":"깜박하고 물감을 안 가지고 왔네.","zh":"我忘了，没带颜料过来呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"깜박하고","meaning":"恍惚，迷糊","explanation":"깜박하다：恍惚，迷糊；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"깜박하다","audio":"/audio/7cd6e59695e222c286cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37731","senseId":"3","lemma":"깜박하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물감을","meaning":"颜料，染料","explanation":"물감：颜料，染料；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물감","audio":"/audio/c1bb4a591933a7e229ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56174","senseId":"1","lemma":"물감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"持，带，戴","explanation":"가지다：持，带，戴；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔네.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7cd6e59695e222c2","term":"깜박하다","zh":"恍惚，迷糊","audio":"/audio/7cd6e59695e222c286cb.mp3","entryId":"37731","definition":"记忆或神志等暂时迷糊不清。","pronunciation":["깜바카다"]},{"id":"c1bb4a591933a7e2","term":"물감","zh":"颜料，染料","audio":"/audio/c1bb4a591933a7e229ab.mp3","entryId":"56174","definition":"绘画或给布、衣服等染色时使用的材料。","pronunciation":["물깜"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"持，带，戴","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"手里握着或身上携带着某物。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/34ab9c137c69c41c2e1d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14649-1-9-2","ko":"준비물을 잘 꾸렸는지 확인을 했어야지.","zh":"应该先检查一下准备的东西是否都带齐了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"준비물을","meaning":"准备物","explanation":"준비물：准备物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"준비물","audio":"/audio/aff0371d971faf30d7b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86438","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"仔细地，专注地","explanation":"잘：仔细地，专注地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"11","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꾸렸는지","meaning":"收拾，打点","explanation":"꾸리다：收拾，打点；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"꾸리다","audio":"/audio/b02f1e7c4232d5a7673c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14649","senseId":"1","lemma":"꾸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"확인을","meaning":"确认","explanation":"확인：确认；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"확인","audio":"/audio/1aacb54c499242964cc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73236","senseId":"1","lemma":"확인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어야지.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aff0371d971faf30","term":"준비물","zh":"准备物","audio":"/audio/aff0371d971faf30d7b6.mp3","entryId":"86438","definition":"事先准备好的物品。","pronunciation":["준ː비물"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"仔细地，专注地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":